<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>On a crowded bar, the panel and Row show your icons instead of a row of arrows. Icons macOS had tucked behind its « got a picture of the « itself. Now they're skipped, and the ones that can't get room in the bar show their app icon (<a href="https://github.com/fif7y/pelmet/issues/81">#81</a>, thanks @2f4vwwb5t6-gif, and <a href="https://github.com/fif7y/pelmet/issues/26">#26</a>, thanks @OiCkilL).</li><li>With more than one display, a right-click on Pelmet's chevron opens its menu on the display you clicked. It used to open where the panel was last open (<a href="https://github.com/fif7y/pelmet/issues/26">#26</a>, thanks @cpierce).</li><li>Icons that sit on a capsule in the menu bar, like Velja's and Herd's, show without it in the panel. On a coloured wallpaper the capsule came out as a box around the icon.</li><li>"Always Hidden" fits on its fold tile, the name is a size under the others.</li><li>The Search tab in Settings gets a New chip, gone once you open it.</li></ul>
]]></description>
